# Test-program build artifacts. Regenerate with sw/tests/build.sh <prog>.S
# The .hex IS tracked: the core harness consumes it directly. The .elf is NOT,
# yet Sail in run_lockstep.sh and the reset-twice run in run_coverage.sh both
# read it, so lockstep does need the RISC-V binutils (comment corrected
# 2026-10-30, docs/results/0030). ci/build_sw_tests.sh rebuilds every .elf
# and requires the rebuilt .hex to equal the tracked one.
sw/tests/*.o
sw/tests/*.bin
sw/tests/*.elf
coverage.dat
obj_dir_cov/
